/godot/issues/105688","id":2886889451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sEm_r","user":{"login":"musjj","id":72612857,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjEyODU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72612857?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj","html_url":"https://github.com/musjj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musjj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T14:29:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T14:31:22Z","body":"In my case (GNOME 47 + Wayland), the lag seems to only happens when the game window is lower than the editor window itself. \n\nIf I manually force the game window to always be on top (with `org.gnome.desktop.wm.keybindings always-on-top`), the editor window no longer lags. I haven't tested this with a larger project so I'm not completely sure.\n\nCan anyone also try to reproduce this?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886889451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2903383886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105688#issuecomment-2903383886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105688","id":2903383886,"nod