      (null)\n- **OS Type:**                                     64-bit\n- **GNOME Version:**                               49\n- **Windowing System:**                            Wayland\n- **Kernel Version:**                              Linux 6.18.5+deb14-amd64\n\nBoth disabling V-Sync and Update Continuously did not change anything for me, is a reboot of Godot required to make these changes?\nI am using the Forward+ renderer, have confirmed running on the Discrete Graphics.\nSlowdown is happening in every launch mode.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3828945352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832890775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105688#issuecomment-3832890775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105688","id":3832890775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kdUWX","user":{"login":"TheOnlyJoey","id":1831986,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzE5ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1831986?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOnlyJoey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOnlyJoey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The